<title>USA: Worthington Foods Inc Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Worthington Foods Inc Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>WORTHINGTON, Ohio 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>THIRTEEN WKS ENDED	APR 4, 1997		 MAR 29, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales		  $26,489,000		   $24,353,000</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold	15,555,000		    15,069,000</p>
<p> Gross profit		10,934,000		     9,284,000</p>
<p> Net income		   1,855,000		     1,287,000</p>
<p> Earnings per share		0.21			    0.15</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs		8,970,969		     8,790,509</p>
